  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_01",
      "hash64": "966BBC4DF81B81B8",
      "text": "Ooohohoho!\\nOoohohohooo![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_02",
      "hash64": "966BBF4DF81B86D1",
      "text": "Das ist also eines der Zehn Wunder Paldeas,\\nvon denen ich so viel gehört habe...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_01",
      "hash64": "9813539872C175D2",
      "text": "Ganz richtig, liebste Onea. Vor dir siehst du\\ndie sogenannten Furienfälle![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_03",
      "hash64": "966BBE4DF81B851E",
      "text": "Sie sind nicht ganz so... beeindruckend, wie ich\\nsie mir vorgestellt hatte...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_04",
      "hash64": "966BC14DF81B8A37",
      "text": "Aber so mickrig die Wasserfälle auch sind,\\nich kann die Negativ-Ionen förmlich spüren![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_02",
      "hash64": "9813529872C1741F",
      "text": "Eine echte Lady wie du lässt sich eben von nichts\\ndie Laune vermiesen![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_03",
      "hash64": "9813519872C1726C",
      "text": "Von dir gehen nicht nur Negativ-Ionen aus,\\nsondern regelrechte VIP-Ionen![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_04",
      "hash64": "9813509872C170B9",
      "text": "Kein Wasserfall der Welt lässt mich so\\nentspannen wie deine Präsenz, uh, là, là![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_05",
      "hash64": "966BC04DF81B8884",
      "text": "Ach Billy, wie recht du doch hast! Auf deine\\nEhrlichkeit ist Verlass.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_06",
      "hash64": "966BC34DF81B8D9D",
      "text": "Oho? Wenn das nicht [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1A17,0000)]unser Vorzeigevertreterunsere Vorzeigevertreterin\\ndes Pöbels ist![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1A17",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_05",
      "hash64": "98134F9872C16F06",
      "text": "Stimmt, das ist [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ersie! Die Geldnot steht [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]ihmihr ins\\nGesicht geschrieben.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_06",
      "hash64": "98134E9872C16D53",
      "text": "Ob das Schicksal [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]ihnsie hergeführt hat? Oder wurde\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ersie von deinen VIP-Ionen angelockt?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_07",
      "hash64": "966BC24DF81B8BEA",
      "text": "Ooohohoho! Sehr gut möglich, mein Lieber![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_08",
      "hash64": "966BB54DF81B75D3",
      "text": "Als VIPs ist es unsere Aufgabe, die Träume von\\ngewöhnlichen Menschen Wirklichkeit werden zu\\r\\nlassen...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_09",
      "hash64": "966BB44DF81B7420",
      "text": "In diesem Sinne: Das hier ist für dich.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_10",
      "hash64": "9668374DF81869E2",
      "text": "Und lass mich noch ein bisschen meiner Weisheit\\nmit dir teilen...\\c\\nMit Geld ist es wie mit den Negativ-Ionen.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_11",
      "hash64": "9668384DF8186B95",
      "text": "Wenn man davon umgeben ist, bietet es einem\\nStabilität und Ruhe.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_12",
      "hash64": "9668354DF818667C",
      "text": "Doch das Glück, das man dadurch erhält,\\nist flüchtig.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_07",
      "hash64": "98134D9872C16BA0",
      "text": "Wow, wie tiefgründig! Aber an einem Kind ist\\ndeine Weisheit garantiert verschwendet.\\r\\nWie Perlen vor die Ferkuli![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_woman_13",
      "hash64": "9668364DF818682F",
      "text": "Wie dem auch sei, Billy. Als Nächstes will ich\\nan einen möglichst [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]abgelegenen Ort[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], hörst du?\\r\\nFür heute hab ich genug von Sehenswürdigkeiten.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_08",
      "hash64": "98135C9872C1851D",
      "text": "Uh, là, là! Du hast dich wohl in kürzester Zeit an\\ndiesen Sehenswürdigkeiten sattgesehen, was?\\c\\nKein Wunder, bei einer Vorzeige-Jetsetterin\\nwie dir![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_man_09",
      "hash64": "98135B9872C1836A",
      "text": "Wie gut, dass ich den perfekten Ort für diesen\\nFall kenne... Er liegt auf der Grenze zwischen\\r\\nder Südlichen Zone 5 und der Südlichen Zone 1![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_004_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "343F29DD74AED680",
      "text": "Señora Onea und Señor Billy haben sich zum\\nberühmten Wasserfall in der Nördlichen Zone 2\\r\\nder Paldea-Region begeben.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
